        },
        "text": "agreed to defer the first issue of Shares, making both issues conditional on shareholder approval."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82448319327733,
          202.0590656175773,
          680.0371113445378,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The second agreement was with Clough Engineering Limited, pursuant to which it agreed to take"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82448319327733,
          222.99762440617576,
          679.9756113445378,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "a placement of 3,225,000 Shares by 29 September 2000, followed by, if approved of by shareholders"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82448319327733,
          243.93617102137773,
          633.1196571428572,
          11.820842933491576
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "at the Company’s annual general meeting, 6,775,000 shares, within 7 days of that meeting."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82446596638655,
          285.8132885985749,
          680.1864857142857,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "On 15 June 2000 the Company announced that with effect from 1 July 2000 it acquired a 50%"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82446596638655,
          306.75183521377676,
          680.1794399159664,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "interest in OIS MOC Joint Venture Pty Ltd, to be paid for by the issue of 800,000 Shares in the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82446596638655,
          327.6903940023752,
          680.2163571428571,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Company. OIS MOC Joint Venture Pty Ltd owns the goodwill of a successful labour hire"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82446596638655,
          348.6289527909739,
          680.1987340336135,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "company. That company is to be renamed Mermaid Labour and Management Limited (MLML)."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82446596638655,
          390.50605819477437,
          680.2374256302521,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "MLML offers a full labour hire service inclusive of industrial relations consultancy, negotiating"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82446596638655,
          411.44460480997634,
          680.2216113445378,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "agreements and awards and were appropriate, provides ongoing management of the labour force."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82446596638655,
          453.3204928741093,
          680.1777172268908,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The effective date is 1 July 2000. The Company will issue 800,000 ordinary fully paid shares in"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82446596638655,
          474.25905166270786,
          256.00517142857143,
          11.820830760094964
